atom: A1_10_window_launch_fix
utc: 2026-06-10T18:04:56Z
head: 0d865a267101469292beb32cbaa8a71542e125f7
note: D5 review blocker - app launched Foreground with ZERO windows (lsappinfo-proven; user could not open the UI). Root cause: MenuBarExtra declared before WindowGroup => SwiftUI launches into the menubar scene only. Fix = scene reorder (WindowGroup first), one file. REAL-RUN predicate: rebuilt bundle, open, osascript window count = 1 (was 0). Headless probes never catch this class - GUI launch smoke registered as debt. swift 53/53, shipgate 16/16.
